      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned child process** \u2014 specifically, a local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup and injects it into the environment immediately before the Ingest agent (or Query agent) child process starts. \n\nThe key point is that the Hub\u0027s own process environment never holds the key. This containment means a compromised Hub process cannot leak the credential by inspecting its own environment variables, since the key exists only in the short-lived child process that actually makes the API calls.",
